  - TypeFullName: BasisHandHeldCameraInteractable
    MemberName: IsInteractingWith
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - input
    Summary: " <summary>Desktop tweak to disable pickup\u2019s internal update loop
      while in desktop mode.</summary>\n <summary>Rescales the camera when the local
      player\u2019s avatar height changes.</summary>\n <summary>\n Per-frame camera
      update (runs after player movement). Handles desktop head binding,\n initializes
      desktop constraint, and always updates pinning & fly movement where applicable.\n
      </summary>\n <summary>Detects landscape vs portrait by camera roll and triggers
      UI orientation updates.</summary>\n <summary>Applies the new orientation to
      the UI and logs it.</summary>\n <inheritdoc />"
    Remarks: 
