  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.UI_Panels.BasisUIInput
    MemberName: moveRepeatRate
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    Summary: Delay in seconds between repeated move actions while  is actuated.
    Remarks: "While  is being held down, the input module will first wait for  seconds\n
      after the first actuation of  and then trigger a move event every  seconds.\n\n
      Note that a maximum of one  will be sent per frame. This means that even if
      multiple time\n increments of the repeat delay have passed since the last update,
      only one move repeat event will be generated."
    Returns: 
    ParamDocs: []
    Example: 
