      is used to convert real world positions and rotations for  pointers into Unity's
      global space.\n When using the XR Interaction Toolkit, this should be pointing
      to the XR Rig's Transform."
    Remarks: This will transform all tracked pointers. If unset, or set to null,
      the Unity world origin will be used as the basis for all tracked positions
      and rotations.
