  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisAudioAndVisemeDriver
    MemberName: BasisAudioAndVisemeDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    Summary: "Connects a uLipSync pipeline to an avatar's facial rig by mapping phonemes
      to\n blendshapes and forwarding audio samples to the lip-sync engine."
    Remarks: "Initialization validates avatar resources, builds a phoneme\u2192blendshape
      table from the avatar's\n FaceVisemeMovement, configures  with those mappings,\n
      and wires visibility callbacks so processing pauses when the face is hidden.\n
      \n Call  each audio frame to drive lip sync.\n Call  when the player/avatar
      becomes available and\n  on teardown."
