  - TypeFullName: UnityEngine.Animations.Rigging.BasisSpineIKConstraintData+BasisSpineIKConstraintJob
    MemberName: BasisSpineIKConstraintJob
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    Summary: "Calibrates original distances INCLUDING the final segment from last
      spine joint to head.\n Layout:\n - m_OriginalDistances[0] = Vector3.zero (root
      padding)\n - For each segment k (hips->spine0, spine0->spine1, ..., spineN-1->spineN,
      spineN->head):\n     m_OriginalDistances[k+1] = next.position - prev.position\n
      Thus, m_OriginalDistances.Length == (hips + spineCount + head) = debugCount\n
      and there are (debugCount - 1) segments total.\n m_OriginalRelativeRotations
      mirrors the segments count (debugCount - 1)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    ParamDocs: []
    Example: 
